---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Financial & Investment Risk Disclaimer (YMYL Compliance)"
  description="Comprehensive YMYL risk disclosures regarding cryptocurrency volatility, non-advisory status, due diligence obligations, and regulatory considerations on newskrypt."
  canonicalUrl="https://cryptopulse.news/disclaimer"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-slate-200">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-700 text-xs font-bold mb-3">
        <span>⚠</span>
        <span>Google YMYL & Financial Regulatory Compliance Notice</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-black tracking-tight mb-3">
        Financial & Investment Risk Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium">Mandatory Financial Advisory Disclaimers Enforced Across All newskrypt Coverage</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-black leading-relaxed">
      <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-6 text-black shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-black mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide">1. Strictly Not Financial or Investment Advice</h2>
        <p class="text-black">The information published on <strong>newskrypt</strong>—including market news, token breakdowns, presale countdowns, technical chart evaluations, yield metrics, and pricing data—is compiled strictly for journalistic, educational, and general informational purposes. None of the editorial material, data endpoints, or contributor analyses constitute, or should be construed as, financial, investment, legal, tax, or accounting advice.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl space-y-4 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-black">2. Extreme Capital Volatility & Total Loss Warning</h2>
        <p class="text-black">Cryptocurrencies, decentralized finance (DeFi) protocols, initial token offerings, meme coins, and derivatives are highly volatile, speculative instruments. Values can fluctuate dramatically within seconds or drop permanently to zero due to market sentiment, systemic liquidity contractions, smart contract exploits, rug pulls, or regulatory actions. You must never commit or speculate with funds you cannot afford to lose completely.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl space-y-4 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-black">3. Mandatory Independent Due Diligence ("DYOR")</h2>
        <p class="text-black">newskrypt makes no representation, warranty, or guarantee concerning the accuracy, completeness, or profitability of any cryptocurrency project, token presale, automated trading algorithm, or protocol discussed. Readers are legally and financially obligated to conduct thorough independent research ("Do Your Own Research - DYOR") and consult with a licensed, credentialed financial fiduciary registered in their local jurisdiction prior to executing transactions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl space-y-4 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-black">4. No Custodial Services or Broker-Dealer Status</h2>
        <p class="text-black">newskrypt is an independent financial journalism publication. We are not a registered broker-dealer, investment advisor, exchange, money transmitter, or custodian under SEC, CFTC, FCA, BaFin, or MiCA regulatory frameworks. We do not solicit investments, process fiat deposits, or manage private cryptographic keys.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>